[I] AT91SAM7 USB specific firmware flasher

[T] sam7utils provides the sam7 utility for flashing firmware onto Atmel
[T] AT91SAM7 microcontrollers via the SAM-BA boot loader over USB. This
[T] version includes enhancements by Milosch Meriac.

[U] https://www.openpcd.org/

